>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `aesop_ss_of`

``` hol4
aesopData.aesop_ss_of : Context.t -> simpExtLib.simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Returns Aesop's simplifier default for a given context.

`aesop_ss_of ctxt` is [`aesop_ss`](#aesopData.aesop_ss) for the context
`ctxt` instead of the ambient one: the simpset follows the `srw_ss`, the
`[aesop_simp]` rewrites and the [`[arith]`](#linarithData.arith) set of
`ctxt`.

### Failure

As for [`aesop_ss`](#aesopData.aesop_ss).

### See also

[`aesopData.aesop_ss`](#aesopData.aesop_ss),
[`linarithData.arith`](#linarithData.arith)
